# Build artefacts we don't need in the docker context
.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/server.log
**/.next
**/out
docs

# Editors / OS
.vscode
.idea
*.swp

# Skip everything except README.md (HF Spaces needs it for metadata) and the
# apps/ tree (which the Dockerfile copies explicitly).
*
!apps/
!README.md
!Dockerfile